sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Integration / Worker / Tests
    participant Program as program.rs
    participant Infer as infer.rs
    participant Traits as traits.rs
    participant Checker as checker.rs
    participant Modules as DashMap<ModuleFullPath, SymbolTable>
    participant Entry as Manual ModuleEntry::Def builders

    alt Unified path (intended primary)
        Caller->>Program: check() / check_form()
        Program->>Checker: ensure_module_exists + shared state access
        Program->>Infer: infer bodies
        Infer->>Checker: lookup / generalize / instantiate
    else Deprecated batch path still present
        Caller->>Program: check_program()
        Program->>Checker: separate registration/body passes
        Program->>Infer: infer bodies again via legacy flow
    else Deprecated REPL path still present
        Caller->>Program: check_repl_input()
        Program->>Infer: infer expr / defn via REPL-specific flow
        Program->>Checker: build display / update state separately
    end

    par Expression-tree work repeated in multiple places
        Program->>Program: apply_subst_to_expr()
    and
        Program->>Program: annotate_expr_from_maps()
    and
        Program->>Program: collect_constrained_calls()
    and
        Infer->>Infer: resolve_deferred_trait_calls()
    end

    alt Non-HKT impl method
        Program->>Traits: register_trait_impl()
        Traits->>Traits: check_impl_method_with_sig()
        Traits->>Entry: build/write annotated Def entry
    else HKT impl method
        Program->>Traits: register_trait_impl()
        Traits->>Traits: check_hkt_impl_method()
        Traits->>Entry: build/write similar annotated Def entry again
    end

    loop Many lookups scan all loaded modules
        Checker->>Modules: iter() for type defs / traits / impls / method origins
        Traits->>Modules: iter() for HKT metadata lookup
    end

    loop New defs / placeholders / builtins / monos
        Program->>Entry: manually construct ModuleEntry::Def
        Traits->>Entry: manually construct ModuleEntry::Def
        Program->>Modules: insert/update symbol table entry
        Traits->>Modules: insert/update symbol table entry
    end
